  "title": "Best Baked Pork Chops",
  "description": "These flavorful pork chops are baked in the oven with a sweet and savory sauce of spicy mustard, maple syrup, garlic, chili powder, and red pepper.",
  "authors": [
    "Kate Lucas"
  ],
